        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLDPOHn-Mg9YElpGbdkJjFBMOJnr-xLuy0rnPYKgIpesLt6VA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "My phone screen was completely cracked.  I took it to Tarek at information-tech and he was amazing!  They fixed my screen quickly!  Tarek was kind, professional and did an amazing job!  He was responsive and super nice!  I highly recommend them!",
        "time": 1745182580,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "STUDIO-VISION",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109341264139404362688/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU51ruyC6N8FTxo0xxQ-Uzq6ggsO3sziKoXGrxpEPFXWljANxo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "After having broken and shattered the screen on my cell phone, I contacted Mr Derek owner of Informa Tech to inquire if he could fix my phone and not only did he fix it within 24 hours but he opened his shop on June 24th, national holiday St Jean Baptiste, to accommodate me and has returned my cell phone to original condition. I highly recommend his services and his professionalism . Many thank-you Derek... AAA+++",
        "time": 1750878939,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Spikeyz TheDragon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116170416687656705151/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXCSPsH88ewdYpojuKSfWCudXZn30OSng0rpkVi50JGK9CUrUAg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Réparation parfaite de mon port de charge\n\nA bit weird and unsettling at first to come to an empty shop and have someone come 5 minutes later in car to unlock the door, well into the opening hours, if i was to do that at my workplace my boss would fire me on the spot.\n\nMessage to the owner, if you didnt know, your employee (s) was not at their post and came in car to unlock the unmanned shop, on both occasions i was there.\n\nAside from that, the repair was impeccable and fast.",
        "time": 1740678253,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gloria Gillman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111012722917406677187/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRA4CAtJTO1S_MQFbVLr3uBR9dL50l2aDfIRKMMyAqmzso3g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I was on a job far from my home when my iPhone 8 stopped charging.  Something went into my phone preventing the connection. I needed GPS and communications for my job!\nLucky I googled Informa Tech.  Due to the storm the lady wasn’t there but showed up in 5 minutes from her doorbell connection . She was honest and gave me the options.  Luckily option number one worked and I was out and back on the job in 15 minutes.  I highly recommend this shop!",
        "time": 1701744245,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Simon Restall",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104545158891032810777/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLlMUCgLdqlKzKacxi1DLH80Se_i3H-4phiWRfT5b5sW_xJwQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Great service.  Walked into their store and they changed my battery on my iPhone 7 within 30 minutes and at a very competitive price!  Would recommend and use again. Thank you!",
